
                  SView - Pipeline ONLINE picture viewer
                 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
            Another FBP (Fun But Pointless) program by Alex May

    superview.library (c)1994 Andreas R. Kleinert. All rights reserved.

Introduction
~~~~~~~~~~~~
   I've *always* wanted to do this program :)  SView (temporary name!)
loads a binary picture (IFF/GIF/JPG/etc) and displays it as text with ANSI
colour!

Installation
~~~~~~~~~~~~
   SView needs the superview.library version 7 which handles all the picture
formats.  See the SuperView archive docs...

Running
~~~~~~~
CLI: SView <Picture FileName> [Screen Width] [Screen Height]

Control
~~~~~~~
 8 - Half page up                <Cursor Up>    - Full page up
 2 - Half page down              <Cursor Down>  - Full page down
 4 - Half page left              <Cursor Left>  - Full page left
 6 - Half page right             <Cursor Right> - Full page right

 <Shift + Cursor Up>    - Goto top of picture
 <Shift + Cursor Down>  - Goto bottom of picture
 <Shift + Cursor Left>  - Goto far left of picture
 <Shift + Cursor Right> - Goto far right of picture

 Q - Quit
 H - Help
